<title>USA: QC Optics Inc Q1 net loss narrows.</title>
<headline>QC Optics Inc Q1 net loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>BURLINGTON, Mass. 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended</p>
<p>							   March 31,</p>
<p>							  1997	  1996</p>
<p> Net sales				    $1,790,692   $3,212,008</p>
<p> Management buyout charge			    0    1,701,000</p>
<p>Benefit (provision) for income</p>
<p>  taxes					    193,400     (21,870)</p>
<p> Net loss					(301,900)  (1,400,859)</p>
<p> Net loss per share			    ( 0.09)	( 0.64)</p>
<p>Weighted average common and  common</p>
<p>equivalent</p>
<p>  shares outstanding			 3,242,500    2,173,174</p>
<p>NOTE:  Net loss for the first quarter of 1996 included a $1.7 million non-cash, non-recurring management buyout charge. The company said the charge was not deductible for either federal or state income taxes and as a result of this charge additional paid-in capital was increased by a like amount, leaving total stockholders' equity unchanged.</p>
